{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 89082, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 62295, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "10-11月日历分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1632467660, "updated_at": 1634110635, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1634110635, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 15, "status": 1, "summary": "这期日历很短，因为21天Raid多占据了一周的格子，继续透露的话，下个月日历就没法做了，理解。各位直接看我的预测就行了。10.14将开启丽莎特别作业活动，按照韩服来看，会赠送：自选4位60+6满技能4", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468995164_15678020.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468773797_53836889.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632467856673_53617958.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 14, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 20865, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 89082, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632467856673_53617958.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632467856673_53617958.jpg\" alt=\"10-11月日历分析\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">这期日历很短，因为21天Raid多占据了一周的格子，继续透露的话，下个月日历就没法做了，理解。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">各位直接看我的预测就行了。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">10.14将开启丽莎特别作业活动，按照韩服来看，会赠送：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">自选4位60+6满技能4星角色</span>，<span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">自选3位60+6满技能5星角色，</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">自选3张任意属性/职业五星券</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">，详细攻略等10.13日再说。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">最近的自选箱子，全给我屯着，别瞎几把乱开，今天自选1个，下周直接送+6，爆笑如雷</span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">了</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">多出来一期的活动<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Secret Halloween翻牌</span>是万圣节活动，将会有3位天子实装，分别是<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">莱玛</span>、<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">提丰（4星）</span>、<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">X（待定）</span>，以下以X为娜塔莉丝进行分析，实际上还有其他可能，如红皇后/法老王，但鉴于日服还未实装，无法知晓技能，在此不过多赘述。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468773797_53836889.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468773797_53836889.png\" alt=\"10-11月日历分析\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">后续活动应该轮到暗Raid—赫菲斯托斯、光WB—千贺</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468995164_15678020.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468995164_15678020.png\" alt=\"10-11月日历分析\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">值</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">得思考的是：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 为什么策划选择在10月中旬开放丽莎作业？明明还有1个半月就周年庆了，和周年庆活动合并不好吗？现在把丽莎作业开了，那周年庆出什么活动呢？总不能再来一次丽莎作业吧？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 再参考韩服，韩服同样也是在周年庆前2个月，即夏日7月活动，把丽莎作业开放了，各位应该还有印象。那韩服周年庆又打算出什么呢？连着开2次丽莎作业不太可能吧？</span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp; 个人猜想：周年庆又是三服同步特殊活动，不是丽莎作业，是全新活动。</span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><br></div><br></div><br></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468995164_15678020.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632468773797_53836889.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632467856673_53617958.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "su